    "Apple Health doesn’t always record resting energy. When it doesn’t, these four figures let Foodge estimate it instead of leaving tonight’s verdict to a guess." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the resting energy estimate.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Apple Salud no siempre registra la energía en reposo. Cuando no lo hace, estas cuatro cifras permiten que Foodge la estime en lugar de dejar el veredicto de esta noche en una suposición."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Health had no resting energy today, so this is estimated from your body basics." : {
      "comment" : "Verdict reason: resting energy came from the Mifflin-St Jeor estimate",
