          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foodge never infers this from Health, and never relaxes it to find a match." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the diet preference.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Foodge nunca deduce esto de Salud, y nunca lo flexibiliza para encontrar una opción."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foodge reads steps, active and resting energy, workouts, dietary energy and sleep. It only ever reads, and it never writes to Health." : {
      "comment" : "A description of what HealthKit can read from Health.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Foodge lee los pasos, la energía activa y en reposo, los entrenamientos, la energía alimentaria y el sueño. Solo lee; nunca escribe en Salud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foodge reads what Apple Health actually recorded, weighs today against your usual fortnight, and proposes one dinner." : {
